---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="The Escape Matrix: The Enneagrammatic Master Grid | History SQ"
  description="Navigate the Nine Hubs according to the Enneagrammatic Law of Three, and assemble the psychological map required to shatter the mechanical sleep of the material world."
>
  <main class="site-wrapper section" style="padding: 0;">
      
    <!-- HERO -->
    <header class="hero reveal" aria-labelledby="hero-heading" style="min-height: 85vh; padding-top: 120px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(198, 166, 100, 0.2);">
      <div style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;">
        <div class="hero-eyebrow">The Master Grid</div>
        <h1 id="hero-heading" style="text-transform: uppercase;">
          The Enneagrammatic Blueprint for<br>
          <em style="display: block; margin-top: 15px;">Cosmic Escape</em>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero-subheadline" style="text-transform: uppercase; font-family: var(--font-display); letter-spacing: 2px;">
          The Escape Matrix
        </p>
        <p class="hero-body">
          Welcome to the unredacted repository of the esoteric continuum. The manuscripts, rituals, and physiological schematics indexed below represent the surviving operative technology of the ancient mystery schools. Navigate the Nine Hubs according to the Enneagrammatic Law of Three, and assemble the psychological map required to shatter the mechanical sleep of the material world.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-ctas">
          <a href="#tier-1-heading" class="btn btn-primary">Initiate the Sequence &darr;</a>
          <a href="/sacred-history/" class="btn btn-ghost">The Exoteric Archive</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- FORCE I: HOLY-AFFIRMING (Gold) -->
    <section class="matrix-tier" aria-labelledby="tier-1-heading">
      <header class="tier-header reveal">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">Force I: Holy-Affirming</span>
        <h2 class="section-title" id="tier-1-heading">The Theoretical Emanation</h2>
        <p class="tier-description">
          The top tier traces the descent of the Divine Light into the simulation, mapping the structural coordinates of the macrocosmic blueprint and the Archontic mechanisms designed to induce spiritual amnesia.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="shsq-cluster-grid reveal reveal-delay-1">
        <article class="shsq-cluster-card">
          <span class="silo-eyebrow">Hub I</span>
          <h3>Gnostic Gnosis</h3>
          <p>Analyze the Nag Hammadi Library, the Demiurgic fracture, and the theology of the trapped divine spark.</p>
          <a href="/gnostic-gnosis/" class="gateway-link">Enter the Canon &rarr;</a>
        </article>
        <article class="shsq-cluster-card">
          <span class="silo-eyebrow">Hub II</span>
          <h3>Hermetic Philosophy</h3>
          <p>Deconstruct the Corpus Hermeticum, the Emerald Tablet, and the macrocosmic physics of Alexandrian alchemy.</p>
          <a href="/hermetic-philosophy/" class="gateway-link">Enter the Tradition &rarr;</a>
        </article>
        <article class="shsq-cluster-card">
          <span class="silo-eyebrow">Hub III</span>
          <h3>Kabbalistic Mechanics</h3>
          <p>Track the mathematical emanation of the Tree of Life, the Sepher Yetzirah, and the Fifty Gates of Understanding.</p>
          <a href="/kabbalistic-mechanics/" class="gateway-link">Unlock the Gates &rarr;</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FORCE II: HOLY-DENYING (Red/Rust Override) -->
    <section class="matrix-tier theme-denying" aria-labelledby="tier-2-heading" style="border-top: 1px solid rgba(201, 122, 106, 0.1);">
      <header class="tier-header reveal">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">Force II: Holy-Denying</span>
        <h2 class="section-title" id="tier-2-heading">The Structural Resistance</h2>
        <p class="tier-description">
          The middle tier confronts the gravity of the Shadow. It decodes the heavy mechanics of universal fate, automated karmic loops, and the physical architecture of the Operative Temple.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="shsq-cluster-grid reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <article class="shsq-cluster-card">
          <span class="silo-eyebrow">Hub IV</span>
          <h3>Sidereal Mythology</h3>
          <p>Decode Astro-Theology, the precessional mechanics of the Stellar Cult, and the geometric ciphers of the Tarot.</p>
          <a href="/sidereal-mythology/" class="gateway-link">Expose the Clockwork &rarr;</a>
        </article>
        <article class="shsq-cluster-card">
          <span class="silo-eyebrow">Hub V</span>
          <h3>Masonic Architecture</h3>
          <p>Expose the symbolic geometry of the Blue Lodge, the Scottish Rite codes, and the ritual drama of Hiram Abiff.</p>
          <a href="/masonic-architecture/" class="gateway-link">Erect the Temple &rarr;</a>
        </article>
        <article class="shsq-cluster-card">
          <span class="silo-eyebrow">Hub VI</span>
          <h3>Occult History</h3>
          <p>Investigate the Enochian operations of John Dee and the Golden Dawn, exposing the technology of ritual frequency.</p>
          <a href="/occult-history/" class="gateway-link">Activate the Engine &rarr;</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FORCE III: HOLY-RECONCILING (Blue/Silver Override) -->
    <section class="matrix-tier theme-reconciling" aria-labelledby="tier-3-heading" style="border-top: 1px solid rgba(106, 181, 201, 0.1);">
      <header class="tier-header reveal">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">Force III: Holy-Reconciling</span>
        <h2 class="section-title" id="tier-3-heading">The Operational Transmutation</h2>
        <p class="tier-description">
          The bottom tier executes the escape plan. It utilizes conscious labor and somatic reprogramming to bypass the False Personality and permanently crystallize the immortal 'I'.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="shsq-cluster-grid reveal reveal-delay-3">
        <article class="shsq-cluster-card">
          <span class="silo-eyebrow">Hub VII</span>
          <h3>Eastern Sciences</h3>
          <p>Study the Vedic somatic energy grids, the Upanishads, and the Dzogchen mechanics of cutting through illusion.</p>
          <a href="/eastern-sciences/" class="gateway-link">Dissolve into the Void &rarr;</a>
        </article>
        <article class="shsq-cluster-card">
          <span class="silo-eyebrow">Hub VIII</span>
          <h3>The Fourth Way</h3>
          <p>Engage with G.I. Gurdjieff’s physics of intentional friction and self-remembering to neutralize mechanical sleep.</p>
          <a href="/the-fourth-way/" class="gateway-link">Initiate the Work &rarr;</a>
        </article>
        <article class="shsq-cluster-card">
          <span class="silo-eyebrow">Hub IX</span>
          <h3>Somatic Alchemy</h3>
          <p>Deconstruct neuro-linguistic programming, biological anchoring, and the cognitive restructuring of the nervous system.</p>
          <a href="/somatic-alchemy/" class="gateway-link">Reprogram the Matrix &rarr;</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- TERMINAL PROMPT -->
    <aside class="shsq-terminal-prompt reveal" aria-labelledby="terminal-heading">
      <h2 id="terminal-heading">The Map is Not the Territory</h2>
      <p>
        You have observed the blueprints. But intellectual accumulation without somatic execution only fortifies the False Personality. To prove your compliance and step outside the mechanical rotation of Heimarmene, you must enter the Crucible.
      </p>
      <a href="https://thethirteenthcoordinate.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-primary">
        Initiate the Air Lock &#8599;
      </a>
    </aside>

  </main>
</Layout>